        "nobel_worthiness": "IceCube opened high-energy neutrino astronomy, a genuinely new observational window on the violent Universe.",
        "attribution": "Halzen was decisive in developing and championing the scientific programme, while Karle made central experimental and detector contributions.",
        "maturity": "The diffuse astrophysical neutrino signal is established with a large, carefully calibrated detector and has transformed the field.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The extent to which individual source identifications are sufficiently secure remains limited.",
