        "nobel_worthiness": "Photonic band gaps supplied a powerful physical idea and an experimental route to controlling light with structured media.",
        "attribution": "John and Yablonovitch introduced defining ideas, and Joannopoulos made foundational theoretical and design contributions.",
        "maturity": "Photonic-crystal physics is established and its concepts underpin a substantial experimental and technological field.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Some ambitious applications have developed more slowly than the original promise.",
          "Priority and credit across theory, fabrication, and early demonstrations deserve review."
        ]
      }
    },
